### ============================================================
### WAREHOUSE MODULE — TEST COMPLETO IN-01 / IN-02 / IN-03 / IN-04
### Servidor: http://localhost:3000
###
### INSTRUCCIONES:
### 1. Ejecuta cada request en orden con "Send Request"
### 2. Copia el ID del response y pégalo en la variable indicada
### 3. PASOS 1-11 = Setup de datos
### 4. TEST IN-01/02/03/04 = Validaciones reales
### ============================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### — Completar a medida que ejecutas cada paso —
@tenantId = a9e72acf-8fc5-472d-81e4-7076c78f4ea4
@branchId = 
@turnId = 
@variantId = 
@warehouseId = 
@warehouse2Id = 
@reportId = 


### ============================================================
### PASO 1 — Crear tenant
### ✅ Copia tenant_id → pega en @tenantId arriba
### ============================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/tenant
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenant_name": "Warehouse Test Corp 2026",
  "contact_email": "wh-test-corp@test.cr",
  "region_id": 1,
  "identification": "7766554433",
  "economic_activity": "742101",
  "sign": "DDS",
  "is_subscribed": true
}

###

### ============================================================
### PASO 2 — Crear branch
### ✅ Copia branch_id → pega en @branchId
### ============================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/branch
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenant_id": "{{tenantId}}",
  "branch_name": "Sucursal Warehouse",
  "branch_number": "001",
  "address": "San José, Costa Rica",
  "contact_email": "branch-wh@test.cr",
  "is_main_branch": true
}

###

### ============================================================
### PASO 3 — Crear turno de trabajo
### ✅ Copia turn_id → pega en @turnId
### ============================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/turns
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "branchId": "{{branchId}}",
  "entry": "08:00",
  "out": "17:00"
}

###

### ============================================================
### PASO 4 — Crear usuario admin
### ✅ Verifica HTTP 201 — no necesitas copiar nada
### ============================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/user
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenant_id": "{{tenantId}}",
  "email": "wh-admin@test.cr",
  "password": "Admin1234!",
  "role_id": 1,
  "employeeInfo": {
    "tenant_id": "{{tenantId}}",
    "branch_id": "{{branchId}}",
    "first_name": "María",
    "last_name": "González",
    "doc_number": "305990002",
    "phone": "70009876",
    "email": "wh-admin@test.cr",
    "payment_schedule_id": 1,
    "contractData": {
      "start_date": "2025-01-01",
      "end_date": "2027-01-01",
      "hours": 40,
      "base_salary": 500000,
      "duties": "Administración de Bodega",
      "turn_type": 1,
      "turn_id": "{{turnId}}"
    }
  }
}

###

### ============================================================
### PASO 5 — Login
### ✅ La cookie de sesión queda automática para todos los requests
### ============================================================
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "wh-admin@test.cr",
  "password": "Admin1234!"
}

###

### ============================================================
### PASO 6 — Crear producto
### ✅ Copia product_variant_id → pega en @variantId
### ============================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/product
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "products": [
    {
      "tenant_id": "{{tenantId}}",
      "sku": "TEST-WH-001",
      "variant_name": "Leche Entera 1L",
      "unit_price": 1500
    }
  ]
}

###

### ============================================================
### PASO 7 — Crear bodega principal (origen)
### ✅ Copia warehouse_id → pega en @warehouseId
### ============================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/warehouse
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "branch_id": "{{branchId}}",
  "warehouse_name": "Bodega Principal",
  "warehouse_address": "San José, La Uruca"
}

###

### ============================================================
### PASO 8 — Crear bodega secundaria (destino)
### ✅ Copia warehouse_id → pega en @warehouse2Id
### ============================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/warehouse
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "branch_id": "{{branchId}}",
  "warehouse_name": "Bodega Secundaria",
  "warehouse_address": "San José, Alajuela"
}

###

### ============================================================
### PASO 9 — Agregar 200 unidades a bodega principal
### expiration_date en ~98 días desde hoy (2026-06-15)
### ✅ Verifica HTTP 201
### ============================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/warehouse/product
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "warehouse_id": "{{warehouseId}}",
  "product_id": "{{variantId}}",
  "amount": 200,
  "expiration_date": "2026-06-15"
}

###

### ============================================================
### PASO 10 — Agregar 50 unidades a bodega secundaria
### ✅ Verifica HTTP 201
### ============================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/warehouse/product
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "warehouse_id": "{{warehouse2Id}}",
  "product_id": "{{variantId}}",
  "amount": 50,
  "expiration_date": "2026-06-15"
}

###


### ============================================================
### ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
###  TEST IN-03 — STOCK CONSOLIDADO POR BODEGA
### ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### ============================================================

### TEST IN-03 A — Stock bodega principal
### ✅ Esperado: HTTP 200 | total_amount = 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/warehouse/{{warehouseId}}/stock

###

### TEST IN-03 B — Stock bodega secundaria
### ✅ Esperado: HTTP 200 | total_amount = 50
GET {{baseUrl}}/warehouse/{{warehouse2Id}}/stock

###

### TEST IN-03 C — Listar todas las bodegas del tenant
### ✅ Esperado: HTTP 200 | array con 2 bodegas
GET {{baseUrl}}/warehouse/tenant/

###

### TEST IN-03 D — NEGATIVO: Bodega de otro tenant
### ✅ Esperado: HTTP 404 "Warehouse...not found for Tenant..."
GET {{baseUrl}}/warehouse/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/stock

###


### ============================================================
### ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
###  TEST IN-01 — TRANSFERENCIA ATÓMICA DE INVENTARIO
### ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### ============================================================

### TEST IN-01 A — Transferir 30 unidades: principal → secundaria
### ✅ Esperado: HTTP 201 | objeto con inventory_transfer_id
POST {{baseUrl}}/warehouse/transfer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "origin_warehouse_id": "{{warehouseId}}",
  "destination_warehouse_id": "{{warehouse2Id}}",
  "products": [
    {
      "product_id": "{{variantId}}",
      "amount": 30
    }
  ]
}

###

### TEST IN-01 B — Stock ORIGEN después de transferencia
### ✅ Esperado: total_amount = 170  (200 - 30)
GET {{baseUrl}}/warehouse/{{warehouseId}}/stock

###

### TEST IN-01 C — Stock DESTINO después de transferencia
### ✅ Esperado: total_amount = 80  (50 + 30)
GET {{baseUrl}}/warehouse/{{warehouse2Id}}/stock

###

### TEST IN-01 D — NEGATIVO: Transferir más stock del disponible
### ✅ Esperado: HTTP 404 "Insufficient stock for product..."
POST {{baseUrl}}/warehouse/transfer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "origin_warehouse_id": "{{warehouseId}}",
  "destination_warehouse_id": "{{warehouse2Id}}",
  "products": [
    {
      "product_id": "{{variantId}}",
      "amount": 9999
    }
  ]
}

###

### TEST IN-01 E — NEGATIVO: Bodega origen inexistente
### ✅ Esperado: HTTP 404 "Origin warehouse...not found"
POST {{baseUrl}}/warehouse/transfer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "origin_warehouse_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "destination_warehouse_id": "{{warehouse2Id}}",
  "products": [
    {
      "product_id": "{{variantId}}",
      "amount": 10
    }
  ]
}

###

### TEST IN-01 F — Confirmar que stock NO cambió tras errores
### ✅ Esperado: total_amount = 170 (igual que IN-01 B)
GET {{baseUrl}}/warehouse/{{warehouseId}}/stock

###


### ============================================================
### ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
###  TEST IN-02 — AJUSTE POR DISCREPANCIA
### ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### ============================================================

### TEST IN-02 A — Crear reporte: delta NEGATIVO (-5)
### Sistema dice 170, físico encontró 165
### ✅ Copia discrepancy_count_id → pega en @reportId
POST {{baseUrl}}/warehouse/discrepancy-report
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "product_id": "{{variantId}}",
  "warehouse_id": "{{warehouseId}}",
  "stored_quantity": 170,
  "physical_quantity": 165,
  "discrepancy_reason": "Conteo físico detectó 5 unidades faltantes"
}

###

### TEST IN-02 B — Ver todos los reportes de la bodega
### ✅ Esperado: array con 1 reporte, is_applied = false
GET {{baseUrl}}/warehouse/discrepancy-report/{{warehouseId}}

###

### TEST IN-02 C — Ver reporte por ID
### ✅ Esperado: stored_quantity=170, physical_quantity=165, is_applied=false
GET {{baseUrl}}/warehouse/discrepancy-report/id/{{reportId}}

###

### TEST IN-02 D — Stock ANTES del ajuste
### ✅ Esperado: total_amount = 170
GET {{baseUrl}}/warehouse/{{warehouseId}}/stock

###

### TEST IN-02 E — Aplicar ajuste (delta = -5 → removeStock)
### ✅ Esperado: HTTP 200 | is_applied = true
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/warehouse/discrepancy-report/{{reportId}}/apply

###

### TEST IN-02 F — Stock DESPUÉS del ajuste
### ✅ Esperado: total_amount = 165  (170 - 5)
GET {{baseUrl}}/warehouse/{{warehouseId}}/stock

###

### TEST IN-02 G — NEGATIVO: Aplicar mismo reporte dos veces
### ✅ Esperado: HTTP 409 "has already been applied"
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/warehouse/discrepancy-report/{{reportId}}/apply

###

### ── PARTE 2: delta POSITIVO ──────────────────────────────────

### TEST IN-02 H — Crear reporte: delta POSITIVO (+10)
### Sistema dice 80, físico encontró 90
### ✅ Copia el NUEVO discrepancy_count_id → actualiza @reportId arriba
POST {{baseUrl}}/warehouse/discrepancy-report
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "product_id": "{{variantId}}",
  "warehouse_id": "{{warehouse2Id}}",
  "stored_quantity": 80,
  "physical_quantity": 90,
  "discrepancy_reason": "Conteo físico encontró 10 unidades extra sin registrar"
}

###

### TEST IN-02 I — Stock ANTES del ajuste positivo
### ✅ Esperado: total_amount = 80
GET {{baseUrl}}/warehouse/{{warehouse2Id}}/stock

###

### (Actualiza @reportId con el ID del paso H antes de ejecutar esto)
### TEST IN-02 J — Aplicar ajuste positivo (delta = +10 → addStock)
### ✅ Esperado: HTTP 200 | is_applied = true
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/warehouse/discrepancy-report/{{reportId}}/apply

###

### TEST IN-02 K — Stock DESPUÉS del ajuste positivo
### ✅ Esperado: total_amount = 90  (80 + 10)
GET {{baseUrl}}/warehouse/{{warehouse2Id}}/stock

###


